ppocr (Rust)

Native inference for PaddleOCR's PP-OCRv6 detection and recognition models
(https://github.com/PaddlePaddle/PaddleOCR), Apache-2.0, by PaddlePaddle.
The preprocessing and postprocessing (DetResizeForTest, DBPostProcess,
RecResizeImg, CTCLabelDecode) follow PaddleOCR/PaddleX's reference behaviour.

Model weights are not part of this repository. They are distributed
separately by PaddlePaddle on Hugging Face under Apache-2.0.
